      "source_text": "この方がゴルシちゃんも大きく見えて\\nオマエらも嬉しいよな！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "308cffdce6e1c0efb0caaf95b46472d576f927389a97a25e218094158c10e6ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75633320e59d769adf2fae46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "メジロ家のアフタヌーンパーティー開催！\\n金のレコード盤プレゼントキャンペーンも開催！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afa4366a681740cf77c0633607e35c4f4a39df6c2e5fe0ce3c06b26e78214af8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee33ebeaab53209f85b07bc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "3rd EVENT WINNING DREAM STAGEの\\nDAY1＆DAY2の歌唱シーン映像を全編収録した\\nBlu-rayが6/15発売！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6e45262bb137f5ed71a448f319a15b47487b31d5df866025b126826d66cc73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80136fbbc2257adca24eae5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "公式ポータルサイトもチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab1f9c3ca4a02ab72ab55f56f20d9d1882228f059cf04369e13a4c8713e941a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce1148d1dde2185b5edcd44d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ゲームの楽曲や撮りおろしソロ曲を収録！\\nメジロ家が歌う「メジロ讃歌」も収録！！\\nCD『WINNING LIVE 07』8/17発売予定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22febd8bc5f6dd488a52ce35027a73f2732a40b69ec9b333c96943dbc517be17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2d5432254cfb45a58b1ac9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "1.5th Anniversary 記念グッズ受注開始！\\n詳しくはウマ娘公式ストアをチェック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab582d7e71d6d2147150c94a31eb2a4674ec49c447a1af6a7a64a980aa3d472",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa95d1a1ac19963cfdabc8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「Gaze on Me!」などゲームの楽曲や \\n録りおろしソロ曲を収録！\\n CD『WINNING LIVE 08』発売中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4478a7361ba376fa9203bd86df398eb9ad7a04d7c17a3ed128d85cb199cd113",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2169f22828fc0b6c81dd8c5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ちっこいウマ娘たちによるショートアニメ！ \\nアニメ『うまゆる』毎週日曜21：00より \\nぱかチューブっ！にて配信中♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51baa581f07eaadd88380c25d8bd3be7a3f58ad611975e9963d011b5a7371e2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b2c6f394b7d94246d8ed4f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "描き下ろし表紙で「ウマ娘」を大特集！\\n三冠ウマ娘座談会など16Pの大ボリューム\\n「Number」1061号好評発売中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c83aa4edefa0edf506c4119dbde76cdcd5eaaeab586de151c726177cd765d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "196",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a23325ca6ff0a898b40d85b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「東京メガイルミ」コラボ開催中！！\\n 詳しくは公式サイトをチェック！",
